{"type":"npc","name":"Tabilda","folder":"gtfya5QlMXbZtjD2","system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":60,"temp":0,"max":60,"details":""},"ac":{"value":19,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","pyric","spirituan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":3},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Tabildas are unusual spirits found in places where frost is feared and life often hinges on the strength of fire. Living embodiments of this duality are tabildas, who are utterly dependent on the delicate flames that burn within their chests. If a tabilda's heartflame is ever snuffed out, its bearer soon perishes alongside it. Tabildas, whose flames have faded, become desperate to restore them as quickly as possible. This desperation psychically weighs upon nearby creatures as the spirit's terror of the cold becomes their own.</p><p>Tabildas wander across frozen landscapes in search of kindling, gathering loose firewood or felling trees with a few well-placed strikes from their hatchets. They gladly offer the warmth of their heartflames to wanderers needing rest, asking only for fuel in return. Groups trekking through the wilderness with flammable goods are sometimes shadowed by a tabilda, much like a stray dog harrying those carrying fresh meat.</p><p>Timid creatures by nature, tabildas prefer to flee from a fight if given the choice. However, tabildas do not take kindly to a disruption in their fuel sources. Settlements that engage in irresponsible deforestation might find a tabilda creeping in at night, cutting chunks out of buildings and burning precious treasures to feed their heartflames.</p><hr /><p>Elemental spirits are spiritual beings who embody one or more elements, though those of composite elements tend to be more complex existences.</p><h2>Watch the World Burn</h2><p>While a tabilda with a well-functioning heartflame tends to be prudent with its resources, a tabilda on the verge of freezing to death becomes frenzied and uncontrollable. Its hunger for warmth becomes insatiable, and it indiscriminately burns anything that will take light, without any concern for saving fuel for tomorrow. Stands of trees, spellbooks, the tents of helpful allies—all become fuel for one great inferno.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 7/18/30 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (slashing), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Survival)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, burning barbs, constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (fire, vitality), fire, fire shield, ice, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision), spirit, strength, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Lachlan Carlsson-Forbes","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":3},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":-2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":9,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":9,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":12,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":9,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":9},"athletics":{"base":10},"survival":{"base":11}},"traits":{"value":["fire","spirit"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"wVA6f8rAb103Umyh","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/tabilda.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Tabilda","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/tabilda.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":