eck[flat|dc:11] at the start of their next turn or the flame is extinguished. The flame is immediately extinguished if the tabilda takes damage from or fails a saving throw against an effect with the air, cold, or water traits. While the flame is extinguished, the tabilda takes persistent @Damage[1d6[cold]] damage. The flame reignites if the tabilda is exposed to fire or successfully uses Kindle.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"heartflame","toggleable":true,"label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitItem","value":true},{"key":"GrantItem","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.lDVqvLKA6eF3Df60","alterations":[{"mode":"override","property":"persistent-damage","value":{"damageType":"cold","formula":"1d6"}}],"predicate":[{"not":"heartflame"}],"inMemoryOnly":true}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"9WTZsfgYq6Z0UyeZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Soothing Fire","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>20 feet.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> The tabilda's heartflame is burning</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The heartflame emanates warmth and bright light. All creatures in the aura gain resistance 5 to cold. The temperature in the aura is two categories warmer than the ambient temperature, to a maximum of normal temperature (for example, extreme cold becomes mild cold).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura"